<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Covance started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Covance started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Covance Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares unchanged at 19-1/4.</p>
